    "text": "I like it, but I don't think the outer hull is \"bulky\" enough. I think we need an armour plating behind each of the hull sections to bulk it out so it's level with the front section. ... I don't like the fact we have pieces that are JUST for this configuration, we need a broader set of angled and bulkhead tiles that all fit together and match what we can make with our floorplan.",
